{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >07GORILLAS is an arena kung fu shooter roguelite where players control a squad that automatically eliminates nearby enemies. Each gorilla unit has unique attacks, passive abilities, and gorilla tag. Utilize these gorilla mark to create diverse squads and gain additional special gorillas resonance bonuses. Players can also purchase unit upgrades in the store to unlock even more powerful abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Actually, we're filming a abstract zombie-killing movie, EVERYTHING IS FAKE.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your squad will automatically attack when enemies approach</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine units with the same GORILLA-TAG to unlock unique GORILLA-RESONANCE bonuses</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clearing arenas grants silvers, which can be used to purchase units at the shop</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy enough copies  of the same units to level up and unlock their  passive abilities</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick Play (under 30 minutes)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ GORILLA-UNITS, each with unique attacks and passive abilities(due to limited funds, they simply wear different colored costumes)(30 in DEMO VERSION)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15+ GORILLA-TAG, each granting a special kill team stat boosts and modifiers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >80+ GORILLA-COMMANDS, each granting a powerful global bonus effects to your squad(20 in DEMO VERSION)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25+ levels, with increasing difficulty as the runprogresses</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3196200?t=1759213137","background_raw":"https://store.